---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import LOPIO from "../../../assets/lopio.png";
---

<Layout>
    <a href="/projects/" class="backToBtn">Back to Projects</a>

    <div class="projectPage">
        <h1>LOPIO</h1>
        <img src={LOPIO.src} alt="Cool ass slack bot" class="largeProjectImg" />
        <p>
            After getting bored of making this website but still needing hours
            for Horizons I decided to make a Slack bot for the channel that
            should've been dead - LOPIO. The premise of LOPIO was simple, a
            slack channel holds one person and one person only. The person sends
            one message, adds someone else, then leaves. <br /><br />The channel
            was doomed to fail from the start. If someone left the channel and
            didnt add anyone else or added a bot (like gork maybe) the channel
            would delete itself. After realising this I decided to make a bot to
            ensure it stays alive. But I had one problem, I wasn't in the
            original channel. So i started following the trail, dming people and
            asking who they added. After messaging around 30 people I had the
            channel!
        </p>
    </div>
</Layout>
